  "date": "2026-10-16",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "央行行长潘功胜：中国将继续实施适度宽松的货币政策",
  "title_en": "PBOC Governor Pan Gongsheng: China will keep implementing an appropriately loose monetary policy",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月15日，二十国集团（G20）财长和央行行长会议在泰国曼谷举行。中国人民银行行长潘功胜参加了会议并发言。这是今年第三次G20财长和央行行长会议。",
      "en": "On October 15, the G20 meeting of finance ministers and central bank governors was held in Bangkok, Thailand. People's Bank of China Governor Pan Gongsheng attended the meeting and gave a speech. This was the third such G20 meeting this year."
    },
    {
      "zh": "潘功胜说，地缘政治冲突是全球经济最大的不确定性。他还提醒，一些国家的国债市场波动很大，人工智能相关资产的价格也可能下跌，这些都会增加金融风险。",
      "en": "Pan said that geopolitical conflict is the biggest uncertainty for the global economy. He also warned that government bond markets in some countries are very volatile and that the prices of AI-related assets may fall, all of which add to financial risk."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在汇率问题上，潘功胜表示，全球经济不平衡不能只靠调整汇率来解决。他认为，汇率受经济增长、货币政策和市场情况等许多因素影响。",
      "en": "On exchange rates, Pan said that global economic imbalances cannot be solved just by adjusting exchange rates. In his view, exchange rates are affected by many factors, such as economic growth, monetary policy and market conditions."
    },
    {
      "zh": "关于中国经济，潘功胜说，中国金融市场运行平稳，长期发展的基础没有改变。央行将继续实施适度宽松的货币政策，支持经济稳定增长。",
      "en": "As for China's economy, Pan said China's financial markets are running smoothly and the foundation for long-term development has not changed. The central bank will continue an appropriately loose monetary policy to support stable economic growth."
    }
  ],
